temp/

# Claude Code: per-developer settings and hookify rules
.claude/settings*
.claude/*.local.md

# graphify: the local knowledge graph, rebuilt by its post-commit hook
graphify-out/

# The local stack (DECISIONS.md sections 240 and 241): it stays on the developer's machine and is
# never pushed. Only the application's inert support for APP_ENV=local is in the repository.
tools/local/
infrastructure/local/
CLAUDE.local.md

# Security audit runs (agent scratch and raw evidence; never committed)
docs/audits/
